---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import MenuIntro from '../components/MenuIntro.astro';
import EntryLink from '../components/EntryLink.astro';
import { bookTitle, bookUrl, getPosts, postDetails } from '../posts';
import profile from '../../images/profile/profile.jpg';
import book from '../../images/profile/spring-security-book.png';

const posts = await getPosts();
const [featured, ...latest] = posts;
if (!featured) throw new Error('홈에 표시할 글이 없습니다.');
const lead = postDetails(featured);
---
<Base page="home" description="강준현의 소프트웨어 엔지니어링 기술 아카이브">
  <main id="main" class="shell home">
    <MenuIntro variant="home" titleId="intro" kicker="SOFTWARE ENGINEERING ARCHIVE">
      복잡한 기술을, <em>깊고 명료하게.</em>
      <div class="hero-aside" slot="aside">
        <p>복잡한 도메인 설계부터 레거시 현대화까지.<br class="desktop-break" /> 현장에서 마주한 문제를 파고들고, 해결 과정과 그 배경이 되는 원리를 기록합니다.</p>
      </div>
    </MenuIntro>
    <div class="home-grid">
      <section id="latest" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <h2 id="latest-title">최신 글</h2>
          <span class="eyebrow">RECENT WRITING</span>
        </div>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="entry-meta"><span>{featured.data.categories[0]}</span><time datetime={lead.date}>{lead.label}</time></div>
          <EntryLink href={lead.href} title={featured.data.title} summary={lead.summary} />
        </article>
        <ul class="entries">
          {latest.slice(0, 4).map((post) => {
            const details = postDetails(post);
            return (
              <li>
                <div class="entry-meta"><span>{post.data.categories[0]}</span><time datetime={details.date}>{details.label}</time></div>
                <EntryLink href={details.href} title={post.data.title} summary={details.summary} />
              </li>
            );
          })}
        </ul>
        <a class="text-link archive-link" href="/posts/">전체 글 탐색 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </section>
      <aside class="home-rail" aria-label="저자와 출간 도서">
        <section aria-labelledby="author-title">
          <div class="author">
            <Image src={profile} alt="" width={112} height={112} />
            <div>
              <h2 id="author-title">강준현 <span>Junhyunny</span></h2>
              <p>소프트웨어 엔지니어 · 작가</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p>Java·Kotlin과 Spring을 중심으로 시스템을 설계하고, 복잡한 도메인 모델링과 성능 최적화를 다룹니다.</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/about/">경력과 프로젝트 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </section>
        <section aria-labelledby="book-title">
          <p class="eyebrow">PUBLICATIONS</p>
          <div class="book">
            <Image src={book} alt="" width={160} />
            <div>
              <h2 id="book-title">{bookTitle}</h2>
              <p>강준현 지음</p>
              <a class="text-link" href={bookUrl}>YES24에서 도서 보기 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
